36. Safe remediation UX
For your AST self-patching functionality, make the agent show a proposed change before applying it.

Example:

CYBER AGENT

I found an unsafe eval() call.

Proposed remediation:

- result = eval(user_input)
+ result = safe_parse(user_input)

[ Review Change ]

[ Apply Patch ]

[ Cancel ]

If possible, show a diff:

- result = eval(user_input)
+ result = safe_parse(user_input)

This is much more trustworthy than silently patching files.

